# How to read the syntax:
# control + x ; control + i: This line defines the chord. The ; (semicolon) is the key. It means "listen for Control+k, then wait for Control+i".
# firefox: This is the command to execute. It MUST be indented by at least one space or a tab.
# sxhkd is flexible, so you can use other modifiers like alt, shift, or super (the Windows key). For a complete list of key names, you can run xev in a terminal and press a key to see its name


